From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 18:29:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: awinic,aw87390: Add Orient Chip OCA72390

The Orient Chip OCA72390 is register compatible with the aw87390 but
reports chip ID 0x11. The one known user, the Zinwa Q25, has no Awinic
ACF configuration file, so like the Anbernic RG-DS it gets a board
compatible that selects a fixed register configuration, with the chip
as the fallback.

Signed-off-by: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw87390.yaml         | 8 +++++++-
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw87390.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw87390.yaml
index 9c1baae7..b3d77892 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw87390.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw87390.yaml
@@ -9,12 +9,14 @@ title: Awinic Aw87390 Audio Amplifier
 maintainers:
   - Weidong Wang <wangweidong.a@awinic.com>
 
-description:
+description: |
   The awinic aw87390 is specifically designed to improve
   the musical output dynamic range, enhance the overall
   sound quallity, which is a new high efficiency, low
   noise, constant large volume, 6th Smart K audio amplifier.
 
+  The Orient Chip OCA72390 is register compatible with the aw87390.
+
 properties:
   compatible:
     oneOf:
@@ -24,6 +26,10 @@ properties:
           - enum:
               - anbernic,rgds-amp
           - const: awinic,aw87391
+      - items:
+          - enum:
+              - zinwa,q25-amp
+          - const: ocs,oca72390
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
